<title>RUSSIA: Russia Jan industry output rises 0.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia Jan industry output rises 0.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian industrial production fell 0.4 percent in January but was 0.3 percent higher than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	JAN 97    DEC 96    JAN 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	  -0.4	+1	  -7</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +0.3	-4	  -5</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
